WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:12,340
Go this way, hold on. We should be not far from the camera.

2
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:23,540
Don't be afraid. Don't be afraid. My cousin is here. My cousin is here.

3
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:36,900
They can't see either. Breathe slowly.

4
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:44,600
Do you see that tree? Climb up. Quick.
